<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/63/msa@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/63/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/63/msa@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "Meterai perbadanan Majlis hendaklah diberikan pengiktirafan rasmi dan kehakiman. Fungsi Majlis"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/63/msa@> .
